    For example here we see that it works with dictionaries

    >>> phonebook = {'Alice':  '555-1234',
    ...              'Bob':    '555-5678',
    ...              'Charlie':'555-9999'}
    >>> get('Alice', phonebook)
    '555-1234'

    >>> get(['Alice', 'Bob'], phonebook)
    ('555-1234', '555-5678')

    Provide a default for missing values

    >>> get(['Alice', 'Dennis'], phonebook, None)
